  "description": {
   "en": "A twisted romance about a former high school student who accidentally cursed his (already taken) crush. The girl was forced to regularly swallow his semen or suffer and die, all despite having a boyfriend.\n\n10 years after this bizarre ordeal, the high school student is now a working adult and struggling in a sexless marriage with another woman. Just as he wants to come clean with his feelings, he has an unexpected reunion. (Manga Mogura)",
   "es-la": "Taku, un estudiante de preparatoria está enamorado de su amiga de la infancia Riko. Sin embargo, los sentimientos de Riko son para su novio, Naoki, que está en el extranjero.\n\"Quiero que Riko me mire\", pide Taku al santuario que cumple los deseos de amor.\nEntonces, Riko es poseída por un demonio y... ¿morirá si no bebe \"eso\" de Taku?"
  },
